hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"936","Al-Hasan bin Qazah told us, Al-Fadl bin Sulaiman told us, on the authority of Musa bin Uqba, on the authority of Nafi’, on the authority of Ibn Umar, on the authority of the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace He, peace and blessings be upon him, said: “If one of you is in need of food, he should not rush until he has fulfilled his need for it, even if the prayer has been established.”"
